        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RKxBQ, Black Steel \"S\" Shutter Dogs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShutter dogs are an easy way to add character to your home. They are designed to hold open window shutters. The Steel \"S\" Shutter Dogs are full of traditional charm from the matte black finish to the old world swirling shape. Sold in pairs--one for each shutter--they are packaged with aluminum anti-rattle hooks, stainless steel fasteners, and anchors for brick application. Available in 2 sizes packaged for brick and wood installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Shutter-Dogs-imag.jpg?v=1704354709\" width=\"299\" height=\"314\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Shutter Dogs\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Steel \"S\" Shutter Dogs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Black</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Lag Screw: 4\" x 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with 2 shutter dogs, 2 lag screws, and 2 aluminum anti-rattle hooks. Anchors are supplied for Brick Application Shutter Dogs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Types</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RK6BQ</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RK4BQ</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Priced and sold in pairs</b> (2 shutter dogs).\r\n</p>",
