                "description": "Black Steel S Shutter Dogs RKxBQ - Shutter dogs are an easy way to add character to your home. They are designed to hold open window shutters. The Steel S Shutter Dogs are full of traditional charm from the matte black finish to the old world swirling shape. Sold in pairs--one for each shutter--they are packaged with aluminum anti-rattle hooks, stainless steel fasteners, and anchors when you select brick application. Available in 2 sizes for brick and wood installation.",
